  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Closure of additional old KLIMA engagements 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KLIMA wishes to engage a consultant to help close old enagagements in the unit. According to the D-report KLIMA will have 221 engagements from July on where annual accounts from partners need to be reviewed and approved in GRAM. For a number of these final result reports will also have to be compiled in order to close the engagement in PMI. The commitment frame of KLIMA has increased significantly in 2024 and is expected to so in 2025 as well. This will result in a larger portfolio of engagements. In order not to create an even larger backlog it is crucial to reduce the number of current pending annual accounts that need to be reviewed in GRAM. A consultant would be able to help us achieve that.</narrative>
  </description>
